{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手林欣彤（Mag）自從9月尾在社交網「蒲頭」後，頻頻在網上發布新消息，見她精神愈來愈好，粉絲也放下心頭大石，而她近日宣布將跟粉絲近距離接觸，似乎已成功克服心魔，不再社恐肯跟外界接觸。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;她將於本月2</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.682106+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T06:01:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_hash":"969b91dbfaf973cebb58163698a4aead4c784ec6bccfc269c3f9208ecc97274f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}